@base = http://localhost:3000

### health check
GET {{base}}/health

### search: multi-term German query
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=Religion Klasse 5&limit=10

### search: strict FTS only
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=koln&mode=strict&limit=10

### search: explicit fuzzy mode
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=geschichte&mode=fuzzy&limit=10

### typo tolerance: misspelled query still matches
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=geschichte

### umlaut folding: ASCII query matches umlaut content
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=koln

### subject synonyms in the data (reli / religion / ethik)
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=reli&mode=strict

### browse newest (empty query)
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=&limit=10

### pagination
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=&limit=5&offset=5

### fetch a single document
GET {{base}}/api/documents/doc_000001

### ingest a single document
POST {{base}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "doc_ingest_demo",
  "title": "Demo ingest",
  "description": "Upserted via POST /api/documents",
  "tags": ["reli", "KLASSE 4"],
  "created_at": "2024-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "preview_image_url": null
}
